{"version":2,"exportedAt":1770076863273,"story":{"title":"Elly-Fly and Kit-Kat Zoom!","userPrompt":"Flying elephants and kitties","authorStyleId":"dr-seuss","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"In the land of Floof, so grand and bright,\nlived Elly-Fly, an elephant of flight!\nWith flappy ears and a happy squeak,\nShe dreamed of friends, a cozy peek!\nAnd Kit-Kat Zoom, a kitty bold,\nWith whisker twitch and stories told!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly, a small, pink elephant with large, floppy ears, smiles widely. Kit-Kat Zoom, a ginger kitten wearing a tiny pilot's cap, stands beside her, tail swishing. Background: Rolling green hills with candy-colored trees. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019773178,"durationMs":4821,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"Elly-Fly said, \"Oh, Kit-Kat Zoom,\nLet's find new lands, escape this gloom!\"\nKit-Kat purred, \"A grand idea,\nAdventure calls, so have no fear!\"\nThey packed their bags with giggle-snacks,\nAnd set off on winding, whooshy tracks!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly and Kit-Kat Zoom packing a colorful backpack filled with silly items like a rainbow-striped lollipop and a rubber chicken. Elly-Fly is stuffing the bag while Kit-Kat Zoom watches with anticipation. Background: Elly-Fly's whimsical house with a chimney shaped like a flower. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019775396,"durationMs":7039,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"They soared up high, past bloopy trees,\nAnd fuzzy clouds, with buzzing bees!\nElly-Fly flapped, Kit-Kat cheered,\nTheir happy sounds, so sweetly geared!\nThey saw the Flibbertigibbet Falls,\nA splashing sight, beyond all walls!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly flying through the air with Kit-Kat Zoom on her back. They are passing fluffy, pastel-colored clouds and cartoon bees. In the distance, a waterfall made of sparkling liquid (Flibbertigibbet Falls). Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019773106,"durationMs":4749,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"They landed soft on Giggletop Hill,\nWhere bouncy berries gave a thrill!\nBut oh dear me, a grumpy Grump,\nWas stomping 'round with a heavy thump!\nHe grumbled loud, \"Go away, you two!\nThis hill's for grumps, through and through!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly and Kit-Kat Zoom standing on a hill covered in large, colorful berries. A large, purple Grump with a frown stands nearby, stomping his foot. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019773223,"durationMs":4866,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Kit-Kat Zoom, with a clever plan,\nPicked a berry, like a happy fan!\nHe offered it to Grumpy Grump,\n\"A taste of joy, a happy bump!\"\nThe Grump looked down, with squinty eyes,\nA berry gift? A sweet surprise!","illustrationPrompt":"Kit-Kat Zoom holding out a large, bright red berry to the Grumpy Grump. The Grump is looking down at the berry with a surprised expression. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019781645,"durationMs":5173,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"He nibbled slow, then took a bite,\nHis grumpy face, began to light!\nA giggle bubbled, then a laugh,\nHe did a jig, in aftermath!\n\"These berries, yum! So sweet and fine!\nPerhaps this hill, can also be thine!\"","illustrationPrompt":"The Grumpy Grump eating the berry and starting to smile. His face is changing from a frown to a happy expression. He's starting to dance a little jig. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019781629,"durationMs":5157,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"Elly-Fly cheered, \"A friend we've found!\"\nThey danced and played, upon the ground!\nThey shared the berries, one and all,\nThe Giggletop, a happy ball!\nNo more grumps, just joyful glee,\nA friendship bloom, for all to see!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly, Kit-Kat Zoom, and the Grump dancing and laughing together on Giggletop Hill. They are surrounded by the colorful berries. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019780527,"durationMs":4055,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"They flew to Spiffington, so grand,\nWith twirly towers, across the land!\nThey saw the Whimsical Wishing Well,\nWhere happy hopes, forever dwell!\nThey made a wish, with hearts so true,\nFor friendship strong, in all they do!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly, Kit-Kat Zoom, and the Grump standing in front of a Whimsical Wishing Well with swirling colors. They are closing their eyes and making a wish. Background: Spiffington, a city with tall, colorful, twirly towers. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019781155,"durationMs":4683,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"They zoomed and flapped, to Flutterby Bay,\nWhere sparkly seashells lit the way!\nThey built a castle, big and bold,\nWith sandy walls, a story told!\nOf kindness shared, and hearts so bright,\nAnd friendship's glow, a guiding light!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly, Kit-Kat Zoom, and the Grump building a sandcastle on Flutterby Bay. The beach is covered in sparkly seashells. They are all working together and smiling. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019786531,"durationMs":3818,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"So Elly-Fly and Kit-Kat Zoom,\nWith Grumpy Grump, escaped the gloom!\nThey learned that day, a joyful thing,\nThat friendship's song, makes hearts all sing!\nWith open minds and hearts so kind,\nNew friends they'd find, of every kind!","illustrationPrompt":"Elly-Fly, Kit-Kat Zoom, and the Grump flying together into a sunset filled with pastel colors. They are all smiling and waving. The sky is filled with stars and fluffy clouds. Bright, warm, whimsical colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1768019788035,"durationMs":5322,"retries":0,"promptLength":676,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small Soft lavender fur with pale pink inner ears elephant, big-expressive Bright turquoise eyes with engaged expression, wearing A bright yellow sundress with white polka dots and puffy sleeves. It has a small pocket for giggle-snacks., with A small, woven basket filled with giggle-snacks. and A tiny flower crown made of daisies, Large, flappy ears, A short, stubby trunk, A constant, happy squeak, A tiny tail that wags constantly, chubby build. in a scene from the story in Floof Land. Child-safe, friendly, no text